{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（18日）上午11時許，警方接獲報案，指深水埗富昌邨富溫樓一單位內，有一名女傭暈倒單位內。消防接報趕至現場破門入屋，發現事主當時已陷入昏迷，並挨住一把風扇。救護員隨即將傷者送往明愛醫院搶救。警方正調查事件起因。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場是富昌邨富溫樓。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188492387454816256391486.jpeg/LxvEafIywm3cUkugvwja_a8_nx2xICl0ZCWrXkElq14\"/><figcaption>現場是富昌邨富溫樓。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"深水埗富昌邨女工暈倒風扇旁，消防破門將她送院。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188485922648231936524930.jpeg/1Bj3sZQf9bRgzI5gGaBuBEUZ4EETxutMw4qWEuaKlhI\"/><figcaption>深水埗富昌邨女工暈倒風扇旁，消防破門將她送院。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"深水埗富昌邨女工暈倒風扇旁，消防破門將她送院。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188485995574595584352064.jpeg/O1_cjx-Ib9rYzNpPr2KPe4jlf875UAFtcOyMsFXsjLA\"/><figcaption>深水埗富昌邨女工暈倒風扇旁，消防破門將她送院。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T06:38:54.112515+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T06:17:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T08:37:40.315145+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T06:37:35.215908+00:00","content_hash":"a1a923c46c629bbe6858bd575107e60b1b28c8e48d40eb9b381582fab7557052","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}